 "notes": [
  "Posted 25 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine. The description calls it a 'pre-tatooine deck', but it uses Tatooine-set podrace cards.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting9': Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon, Start Your Engines!, Boonta Eve Podrace, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Sebulba's Podracer, All Wrapped Up; they count toward the 60.",
  "The list totals 60 as published (the Characters header says 18 but 19 are listed; 4 Droids are under an unnumbered header).",
  "Dark pages dested for the dual-printed cards: Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark), Boonta Eve Podrace (Dark), Tatooine: Podrace Arena (Dark), Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 (Dark), Skiff (Dark), Vibro-Ax (Dark).",
  "Posted 'Boba Fett (CC)' dested Boba Fett (Cloud City); 'Boba Fett w/ gun' dested Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle (Enhanced Premiere); 'Boba Fett's gun' dested Boba Fett's Blaster Rifle.",
  "Posted 'Dengar w/ gun', 'Bossk w/ gun', 'IG-88 w/ gun' and '4-LOM w/ gun' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine, Bossk With Mortar Gun, IG-88 With Riot Gun and 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle.",
  "Posted 'Mara Jade, TEH' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Mara Jade's stick' dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'There Is No Try & OI' dested There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement; 'TatooineDocking Bay' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Scum 'n Villany' dested Scum And Villainy."
